Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">美国政府暂停微软及Adobe等IT巨头参与技术人才绿卡计划</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">智谱AI发布新一代大模型路线：GLM-5.4与GLM-5.5参数突破万亿</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI发布GPT-6.1 Sol Ultrafast版，API与平台运行速度提升8倍</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">谷歌云发布通用Gemini智能体，支持自主拆解并执行复杂多步骤任务</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/27234ec0b3f822767f2f5a2fd87eb889.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">谷歌云在“Gemini at Work 2026”大会上正式推出面向企业客户的通用Gemini智能体（Gemini Agent）。该产品旨在通过一站式界面实现工作流程自动化，用户输入宏观目标后，智能体可自主完成问答、知识沉淀、内容创作及代码编写等复杂任务，并直接将成品交付至Gmail、Docs或开发工具中。在生态兼容性方面，该智能体支持Gemini Enterprise、Workspace及第三方服务，并引入模型动态选择机制，允许用户在谷歌模型与Anthropic Claude等模型间灵活切换。针对行业应用，谷歌云同步发布了面向数据分析、机器学习的技能，以及金融与法律行业的定制版本。为保障企业级部署，该智能体标配权限管理、审计日志、安全沙箱及实时支出上限控制等功能，旨在通过全流程自动化提升企业协作效率与生产力。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">苹果将于10月13日举办智能家居发布会，推出全新AI中枢硬件</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/dd49407639f6eca75230a67d7acd7c1c.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">苹果公司正式宣布将于10月13日在纽约举办“Welcome home”发布会，这是新任CEO John Ternus上任后在智能家居领域的首个重大战略动作。发布会核心看点是一款采用约6英寸方形显示屏的全新智能家居中枢硬件，支持桌面摆放与墙面挂载。此外，性能升级的新版Apple TV 4K流媒体机顶盒及升级版HomePod mini智能音箱也将同步亮相。全线新品底层深度融入最新的Siri AI技术，旨在通过终端硬件升级与生成式AI能力的结合，重塑全屋智能生态入口。苹果此举意在通过强化硬件协同与生成式交互，在智能家居下半场竞争中对抗亚马逊与谷歌，重新定义端侧智能体验。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">美国政府暂停微软及Adobe等IT巨头参与技术人才绿卡计划</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/483865a530ff58c3fbdf5be08033bb27.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">10月8日，特朗普政府正式暂停微软、Adobe、凯捷、高知特、HCL、印孚瑟斯、塔塔集团及威普罗等IT巨头参与外国技术工人绿卡计划，并指控相关企业存在欺诈行为。美国劳工部部长基思·桑德林宣布，政府将停止受理上述公司所有新的或正在审批的永久劳工认证申请。副总统JD Vance表示，此举旨在优先保障本地就业，政府后续还将调查九所知名高校是否存在滥用国际学生项目压低薪酬的行为。微软对此回应称，其上财年约6000份H-1B申请中，80%为现有员工身份延期，新员工申请仅占美国员工总数的1%，且均符合同工同酬标准。鉴于科技行业近四分之三的签证流向印度籍人才，此次政策收紧将直接冲击大型科技公司的核心研发梯队建设，并可能重塑全球高科技人才的流动格局。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">智谱AI发布新一代大模型路线：GLM-5.4与GLM-5.5参数突破万亿</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/2005366d3b30a5a217976b7a1e0f1295.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">智谱AI近日披露新一代旗舰大模型GLM-5.4与GLM-5.5的技术路线，正式宣布模型参数量跨入万亿级别，并采用双轨技术路径向AGI目标迈进。此次研发重点在于解决超大规模参数下的训练与推理效率平衡问题，通过架构创新提升复杂推理、长文本处理及多模态理解能力。智谱通过并行探索两条全新技术路径，旨在打破传统架构性能瓶颈，在保持强大泛化能力的同时，显著提升复杂任务处理效率并降低企业级应用落地门槛。随着这两款万亿级模型的研发推进，其在复杂逻辑推理及行业垂直Agent场景中的表现，将成为衡量国产大模型在超大规模参数训练与前沿架构创新方面追赶全球顶尖水平的关键指标。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI发布GPT-6.1 Sol Ultrafast版，API与平台运行速度提升8倍</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/582a5a22738f6362a99e79de2688fac9.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI正式在API、Codex及ChatGPT Work平台推出GPT-6.1 Sol Ultrafast版本，该版本运行速度最高可达标准版的8倍。定价方面，Ultrafast版收费为标准版的6倍，即每百万tokens输入12美元，输出60美元。目前该功能已在Codex和ChatGPT Work上线，面向Pro500用户、符合条件的按量付费企业版及配额计费教育版开放，企业用户需由管理员在后台手动开启。该版本已在所有支持区域完成部署，并全面支持美国和欧盟境内的数据驻留合规服务。此次更新旨在通过显著的性能提升，满足高并发、低延迟的生产环境需求，为企业及开发者提供更高效的模型调用选择。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
